<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin to meet Belarus leader in morning.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin to meet Belarus leader in morning.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian President Boris Yeltsin will meet Belarussian President Alexander Lukashenko on Wednesday morning, his press service head, Igor Ingatyev, said.</p>
<p>Yeltsin, 65, is currently in the Barvikha sanatorium outside Moscow while doctors prepare him for an operation to improve blood supply to his heart.</p>
